How to Run

1. Install MySQL.
2. Set up the database and required tables.
3. Load the dataset into the database.
4. Open "sql_project.sql" in MySQL Workbench.
5. Execute the queries section by section.

Note: The SQL file references an existing database and tables. The database creation and dataset-loading scripts are not included in this version.

Project Objective

To demonstrate practical SQL skills through financial transaction analysis, fraud pattern investigation, account risk assessment, and network-based fraud analysis.
